  "repo_truth": "Final aggregate review closed both hash/baseline P1s but found symbol/risk omission bypass and retained end-to-end proof P2. Parent selected exact attested GitNexus evidence with actual-path/evidence/summary/grant parity and reserved a supplemental CLEAN review plus future HCM-3.2 evidence path.",
