  "tasks": ["Implement evidence schema/template and validator replay.", "Change exact HCM-3.2 fixture to nonempty evidence and add missing/empty/omitted/unauthorized/understated negatives.", "Run compile, ordinary validation, both self-tests, exact fixture, live dispatch replay where applicable, diff/UTF-8/whitespace, and return changed paths/results."],
